  "prefLabel": "Fis 503.04 Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 503.04 Reporting.\n\n(a) Any person conducting a fishing tournament, except kids derbies as described in Fis 503.05(k) and black bass tournaments reported as specified in paragraph (b) below, shall submit form “General Tournament Record Form”, Rev 01/26, available online at https://www.wildlife.nh.gov/fishing-new-hampshire/tournaments.\n\n(b) Any person conducting a black bass tournament, as specified in Fis 503.06, shall complete the on-line form “Bass Tournament Record Form”, Rev 01/26, available at https://www.wildlife.nh.gov/fishing-new-hampshire/tournaments.\n\n(c) In addition to the requirements in paragraph (a) above, fishing tournaments with a lake trout or landlocked salmon category shall report individual lengths and weights of fish entered.\n\n(d) All record forms shall be completed within 30 days after the end of the fishing tournament.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at chapter headings for Fis 400 and Fis 500) #5016, eff 1-1-91, EXPIRED: 1-1-97\n\nNew. #6478, INTERIM, eff 3-28-97, EXPIRED: 7-26-97\n\nNew. #6917, eff 12-22-98; ss by #8119, eff 1-1-05; ss by #10279, eff 2-28-13; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13798, eff 11-1-23; ss by #14445, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES: 1-2-36",
